				<title>孤独</title>
				<link>http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/being-alone</link>
				<description>


&lt;div style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/nav%3Aside/styleFrame.html?bhl&quot; name=&quot;typeFrame&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jeffreycc&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5913267&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609467172&quot; alt=&quot;JeffreyCC&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5913267)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jeffreycc&quot;  &gt;JeffreyCC&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
